      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:10.876000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "There's a lot uh, of tech debt in that area, for what it's worth.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:11.106000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:16.490000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "That's fair.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:17.492000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:18.292000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "I hadn't thought about it that way.",
      "start_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:18.657000Z",
      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:21.350000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Okay, so where did we land on that last time?",
