      "end_time": "2026-09-21T09:06:51.936000Z"
    },
    {
      "speaker": {
        "source": "speaker"
      },
      "text": "Also heads up, Sam's moving onto the Corvid SSO work, so Tomás is taking over Falcon from today.",
